# gfx-demo

Draws a one-bit scene with fill, pixels, lines, outlines, and filled
rectangles. It turns the scene clockwise through four orientations and holds
each one long enough to inspect. A one-bit panel receives packed pixels; a
sixteen-bit panel receives RGB565 rows with red, green, and blue palette
regions turned with the scene, followed by a direct RGB565 swatch in the
centre. The packed composition is identical on both depths.

The application uses mm.gfx, mm.display, and mm.mcu. It has no font, board,
SDK, or vendor dependency.
